==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~25 seconds<sup>700f~750f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 18.33 seconds<sup>550f</sup>, delay 23.33~25 seconds<sup>700f~750f</sup>.
*6 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~25 seconds<sup>700f~750f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gudetama Plate (Enemy)|Gudetama Plate]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gudegude à la mode (Enemy)|Gudegude à la mode]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**16 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**16 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**4 [[Gudetama Plate (Enemy)|Gudetama Plates]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

